\par 
\par You will find in these folders the entire content and documents for the website and the documents for the registration of participants relating to the ACA'2009, conference held in Montr\'e9al in 2009. 
\par 
\par Some of the documents are plain htm
l files, using as little as possible complicated coding. Other pages, which would interact with the database (like the registration page, the list of accepted talks etc.) were done with programming *.asp pages. I have not cleaned up this code and this is 
not very efficient programming (I had no technical help and I usually don't do programming so I only made what I could for it to work...)
\par 
\par The final version of the website is still online at this address: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 http://aca2009.etsmtl.ca/ }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 
\par I have not included the photos in the present zip files. 
\par 
\par The main access is with the index.html file in the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 ACA2009}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004  folder.
\par 
\par The submission of proposals for the conference was managed by each session's organizers or chairs. But, to coordonate the overall conference, each accepted proposal or talk was entered in our database using this page:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid15351004 
