\par 
\par In the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 aca2009dev }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 
folder, you will find the files used to show on the website the list of registered delegates and the list of accepted talks. In the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 aca2009dev/admin }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 folder you will find files used to manage, via a web interface, the information in the database regarding delegates and accepted talks. This was done via the web but with an autorized access only. The }{\rtlch\fcs1 
\ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 aca2009dev/admin/proposal/LstProposition.asp }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 
page was used by myself to manage the database for all the information about the proposal including when came time to construct the final scedule and assigning dates, time and room number to each proposal. The  }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\cf1\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 aca2009dev/admin/register/LstRegister.asp }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 
page would manage the information about the delegates. We could this way keep track of some information (who has paid, food allegy etc.)
\par 
\par 
\par In the register folder, you will find the pages f}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 or on-line registration which we}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 re}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 ,}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004  for the time of the conference}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 ,}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 
 on a secure part of a webserver in our university, so participants would feel secure in giving their credit card information online. But we did not have a transactional site. The majority of people registering gave online information with credit
 card number to pay registration fees and we manually made the payment by phone after}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004  receiving the information. Credit card}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 
 is by far the best way to have delegates pay the registration fees.
\par  
\par You will also find a copy of the database used (called base-aca2009.
mdb) in the "admin" folder. This database contains personnal information on the participants and should be considered with great care; I send it to you only to illustrate how we worked. In order to work properly, your technicians will have to link on your
 webserver this database with the name used in the programming of the *.asp pages. 
\par 
\par Some information has changed in time. For example, registration fees would change (standard or late...) meaning we had to change this information on the website. I'm sending you }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 only }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid15351004\charrsid15351004 the final version of the ACA'2009 website.
\par 
\par Don't hesitate to use whatever you
 want in these documents or web pages. You can always contact me at anytime if you need help or if you want more information. Organizing a conference like this is a lot of very interesting work but do use all the help you can get, and talking to people wh
o have done it before can be very useful. I will be glad to help or give you advice if needed.
\par 
\par A final note: I'm sending all this information for the sole purpose of helping you with the organisation of the ACA'2010 conference. Any other use of this information should be cleared by me beforehand.
